%% Query path. Authoritative version: assets/architecture/07-rag-query-flow.svg
flowchart LR
  Q["query"] --> E["embed with BGE-M3<br/>same model as the corpus"]
  E --> R["hybrid retrieval<br/>dense + sparse prefetch"]
  R --> QD[("Qdrant<br/>RRF fusion, server-side")]
  QD --> C["cited chunks<br/>law + section_number in the payload"]
  C --> CB["Legal Chatbot<br/>existing component"]
  NE[("Neo4j<br/>what each provision cites")] -.-> CB
  CB --> LLM["self-hosted LLM<br/>OpenAI-compatible endpoint"]
  LLM --> ANS["grounded answer with provisions"]
  ANS -.->|designed, not implemented| CV["validate each cited section<br/>against the corpus"]
